ITEM NOTES 12 ADD="Too heavy for the rack; keep it off the damp floor on its pallet."
ITEM NOTES 21 ADD="Park the heads before moving it."
LOC NOTES DESK ADD="Keep the anti-static mat on the bench."
LOC NOTES GAR ADD="Unheated: no floppies, manuals or loose cards out here."

